<title>USA: Elkhorn, Wis., won by EVEREN Sec..</title>
<headline>Elkhorn, Wis., won by EVEREN Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Sec. said it won $1.445 million of Elkhorn, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, with a true interest cost of 4.7745 percent.</p>
</text>
